  "name": "Release CultureOS to the board",
  "notes": "build -> bundle -> sign+publish -> start the board's update -> poll for the outcome. Every step runs on spark through the runner actor and fails the run on a non-zero exit, so a failed build, bundle or publish never reaches the board, and the run succeeds only when the board boots the published commit as its default. The outputs are the git commit built, the published OSTree commit, the bundle path, the board's trigger JSON and its final status JSON (docs/os/release-workflow.md).",
